    ",{\"vid\":\"huEtJw7pfLk\",\"title\":\"Youtube duet: Miles Davis improvising on LCD Soundsystem\",\"channel\":\"Alessandro Grespan\",\"summary\":\"A mashup that plays a Miles Davis improvisation video alongside an LCD Soundsystem clip with no editing, so the two seem to perform together. It also became known for an affectionate mouse cursor moving along.\",\"why_hn\":\"Commenters repeatedly call it a favorite and a mind-blowing introduction to jazz.\",\"content_type\":\"music\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"music mashup\",\"categories\":[\"Music performance & songs\",\"Internet culture & memes\"],\"tags\":[\"miles davis\",\"lcd soundsystem\",\"jazz\",\"mashup\",\"youtube\"],\"quote\":\"which served as one of my most memorable early introductions to jazz\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":6.0},{\"vid\":\"iHzzSao6ypE\",\"title\":\"Traffic Has a Perfect Solution. Humans Are the Problem.\",\"channel\":\"CGP Grey\",\"summary\":\"CGP Grey explains how traffic jams come from human driving behavior such as tailgating and reaction delays, and how leaving gaps and smoothing speed would reduce congestion. It also touches on self-driving cars.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN cites it as a concise, well-illustrated explanation of traffic flow, in threads on congestion, self-driving cars and driving habits.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"traffic flow\",\"categories\":[\"Transit, cities & urban planning\",\"Self-driving & autonomous vehicles\",\"Psychology & human behavior\"],\"tags\":[\"traffic jams\",\"congestion\",\"self-driving cars\",\"driving behavior\",\"phantom jams\"],\"quote\":\"CGP Grey did a really nice, concise video on the topic of traffic\",\"recommenders\":6,\"score\":6.0},{\"vid\":\"jo_B4LTHi3I\",\"title\":\"Introduction to Node.js with Ryan Dahl\",\"channel\":\"InfoQ\",\"summary\":\"Ryan Dahl, the creator of Node.js, introduces the event-driven I/O framework built on V8 with examples, and discusses the v0.4.0 release and 