nimums and zoning\",\"categories\":[\"Transit, cities & urban planning\",\"Climate policy, solutions & debate\"],\"tags\":[\"parking\",\"zoning\",\"urbanism\",\"car dependence\",\"ite\",\"housing\"],\"quote\":\"This is a good video about the history behind idiotic American zoning laws and parking minimums.\",\"recommenders\":6,\"score\":5.5},{\"vid\":\"P3AyI_u66Bw\",\"title\":\"Larry Hastings - Removing Python's GIL: The Gilectomy - PyCon 2016\",\"channel\":\"PyCon 2016\",\"summary\":\"Larry Hastings explains what Python's GIL is, what problems it solves and how it works, and presents his Gilectomy project to remove it, including the performance and C-extension obstacles.\",\"why_hn\":\"The default reference in Python performance threads for why removing the GIL is hard.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"advanced\",\"primary_topic\":\"python gil removal\",\"categories\":[\"Python, Ruby & scripting languages\",\"Software performance & optimization\",\"Operating systems & kernels\"],\"tags\":[\"python\",\"gil\",\"gilectomy\",\"multithreading\",\"cpython\"],\"quote\":\"I think Larry Hasting's first Gilectomy talk was extremely insightful\",\"recommenders\":5,\"score\":5.5},{\"vid\":\"PE4gwstWhmc\",\"title\":\"How We've Scaled Dropbox\",\"channel\":\"Stanford\",\"summary\":\"Dropbox engineer Kevin Modzelewski gives a Stanford colloquium on Dropbox's history and the technical problems it faced scaling, including detailed database schema decisions.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as a detailed, candid case study of scaling a real system from zero users to millions.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"scaling dropbox architecture\",\"categories\":[\"Distributed systems\",\"Databases & storage\",\"Cloud, DevOps & reliability\"],\"tags\":[\"scaling\",\"dropbox\",\"databases\",\"system architecture\",\"mysql\"],\"quote\":\"I found the Dropbox lecture [1] at Stanford one of the most riveting things ever.\",\"recommenders\":5,\"score\":5.