pany stories & documentaries\",\"Internet culture & memes\"],\"tags\":[\"fake likes\",\"click farms\",\"facebook ads\",\"advertising\",\"veritasium\"],\"quote\":\"See a real live experiment someone did, to figure out the true reach and ROI on Facebook Advertizing.\",\"recommenders\":7,\"score\":5.0},{\"vid\":\"oqu5DjzOBF8\",\"title\":\"I Misunderstood the Greenhouse Effect. Here's How It Works.\",\"channel\":\"Sabine Hossenfelder\",\"summary\":\"Sabine Hossenfelder explains how the greenhouse effect actually works, given that infrared is mostly absorbed low in the atmosphere already. She walks through why more CO2 still warms the surface.\",\"why_hn\":\"Recommended as an accessible, nuanced explanation of the mechanics of global warming, including the saturation puzzle.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"greenhouse effect\",\"categories\":[\"Climate science & climate change\"],\"tags\":[\"climate change\",\"co2\",\"greenhouse gases\",\"atmospheric physics\",\"saturation\"],\"quote\":\"this video explains the mechanics of global warming in a way anybody can understand.\",\"recommenders\":5,\"score\":5.0},{\"vid\":\"ph8LyNIT9sg\",\"title\":\"The Road to PS5\",\"channel\":\"PlayStation\",\"summary\":\"PS5 lead system architect Mark Cerny gives a deep dive into the PS5's architecture, covering its SSD, I/O, audio and design goals. He explains how removing bottlenecks shapes future games.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN treats it as required viewing for understanding the PS5's SSD and architecture beyond raw specs.\",\"content_type\":\"talk\",\"level\":\"intermediate\",\"primary_topic\":\"ps5 system architecture\",\"categories\":[\"Computer architecture & CPUs\",\"Game programming & engines\",\"Game history & retro gaming\"],\"tags\":[\"ps5\",\"mark cerny\",\"ssd\",\"console hardware\",\"game engines\"],\"quote\":\"IMO required viewing for any dev to form a more informed opinion on the SSD tech.\",\"recommenders\":6,\"score\":5.0},{\"vid\":\"qID