h company stories & documentaries\"],\"tags\":[\"travis kalanick\",\"uber\",\"startups\",\"failure\",\"entrepreneurship\"],\"quote\":\"I would really recommend watching this talk[1] TK gave at Failcon back in 2011.\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"39iKLwlUqBo\",\"title\":\"Steve Jobs on privacy, Steve Jobs at the D8 Conference (Video)\",\"channel\":\"iwasjojo\",\"summary\":\"A short clip of Steve Jobs at the 2010 D8 conference, interviewed by Walt Mossberg, defining privacy as people knowing what they are signing up for, in plain English and repeatedly. The discussion centered on location data.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN reaches for it constantly as evidence of Apple's long-standing privacy stance and as a yardstick for judging Apple, Facebook and others.\",\"content_type\":\"interview\",\"level\":\"general\",\"primary_topic\":\"privacy and consent\",\"categories\":[\"Privacy, surveillance & cybercrime\",\"Tech pioneers & interviews\"],\"tags\":[\"steve jobs\",\"apple\",\"privacy\",\"d8 conference\",\"user consent\"],\"quote\":\"Privacy means people know what they’re signing up for. In plain English, and repeatedly.\",\"recommenders\":4,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"3BR8tK-LuB0\",\"title\":\"Fantastic Quaternions - Numberphile\",\"channel\":\"Numberphile\",\"summary\":\"Numberphile's James Grime introduces quaternions, a type of number beyond the complex numbers, building up from real and complex numbers and explaining why they are useful.\",\"why_hn\":\"HN recommends it as the simplest, most approachable introduction to quaternions, useful for people working in games and robotics.\",\"content_type\":\"explainer\",\"level\":\"intro\",\"primary_topic\":\"quaternions\",\"categories\":[\"Recreational & visual math\",\"Pure mathematics\"],\"tags\":[\"quaternions\",\"complex numbers\",\"hamilton\",\"3d rotation\",\"numberphile\"],\"quote\":\"Numberphile's explanation of Quaternions is the simplest I have seen so far\",\"recommenders\":3,\"score\":4.0},{\"vid\":\"3GObi93